			"notes": "First working release.\n\nThe mod features new workstations, new materials, magical energy, and a research system with a corresponding book.\nATTENTION! THIS IS THE FIRST PUBLIC ALPHA RELEASE. IT MAY CONTAIN CRITICAL BUGS AND ERRORS.\n\n(Первый рабочий релиз.\n\nВ моде реализованы новые рабочие станции, новые материалы, магическая энергия и система исследований с соответствующей книгой.\nВНИМАНИЕ! ЭТО ПЕРВЫЙ ПУБЛИЧНЫЙ АЛЬФА РЕЛИЗ, В НЁМ МОГУТ СОДЕРЖАТЬСЯ КРИТИЧЕСКИЕ БАГИ И ОШИБКИ)\n\n\nNew trees (Новые деревья)\n<img width=\"1086\" height=\"842\" alt=\"NumenWood\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbfe6c9c-0c5e-4150-84ca-1043b7ddbabe\" />\n<img width=\"1226\" height=\"895\" alt=\"LumenWood\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ad75f52-dc35-47c1-a147-b65274622411\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"788\" alt=\"UmbraWood\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/391dcf3b-0c7d-4325-87e5-03baa490b1e3\" />\n<img width=\"632\" height=\"534\" alt=\"TurqouiseBush\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7246d646-62eb-46d5-a594-1a428c5cf79c\" />\n\n\nNew stations and equipment (Новые станции и снаряжение)\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"671\" alt=\"Crucible\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33c99d56-9c28-4165-affc-509c7a3ea1c6\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"674\" alt=\"HouseNewWorkplace\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76d1247d-ec1e-4f55-b2e7-c51fa1a2634d\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"670\" alt=\"NumenologAndNewWorkstation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cad5cdf-645e-490a-83ae-1bd6146ec6e6\" />\n\nBook of Research (Книга исследований)\n<img width=\"1258\" height=\"799\" alt=\"NumenCodex\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12ef60df-6ebf-4eb9-bc27-669eae9c08f3\" />\n\nEnergy nodes (Узлы энергии)\n<img width=\"818\" height=\"725\" alt=\"NodeEnergy\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acc07e48-041e-4323-9d90-4e89f2b1361d\" />\n\nN